      "writtenOn": "2021-05-10T22:22:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Aha, thanks.\n\nRe: \n\nDynamic_deps:                  linkerAttrs.dynamicDeps,\nDynamic_deps_for_shared:       sharedAttrs.dynamicDeps,\n\nI introduced Dynamic_deps just for cc_shared_library, and they are currently only used for cc_shared_library. \n\nSo I still find the names a little confusing\n\nMaybe we should rename Dynamic_deps to Dynamic_deps_common ?\n\nPS. Do you expect that Dynamic_deps/Dynamic_deps_common will be used for cc_library_static as well? I saw http://b/187746106 but it is not clear what the intention is",
